{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2022-12-09 10:48:00', 'title': 'ABBOTT INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, MARKING 51 CONSECUTIVE YEARS OF DIVIDEND GROWTH', 'text': "DIVIDEND INCREASED BY 8.5% REFLECTS ABBOTT'S LONGSTANDING COMMITMENT TO SUSTAINABLE GROWTH AND SHAREHOLDER RETURNS ABBOTT PARK, ILL., DEC. 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ABBOTT (NYSE: ABT) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS INCREASED THE COMPANY'S QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND TO 51 CENTS PER SHARE, AN INCREASE OF 8.5%."}